      "id": "claim_6953198e8c5d4886a865c2f3b32d9b22",
      "statement": "LangChain packages use uv with dependency groups defined in pyproject.toml: lint (ruff), typing (mypy), test (pytest and utilities), test_integration (integration testing tools), and dev (development tools like Jupyter); uv sync --all-groups installs all groups, while group-specific flags like uv sync --group test install only that group",
