      "statement": "Pre-commit hooks in .pre-commit-config.yaml enforce code quality through: standard validation (YAML/TOML syntax, file endings, whitespace), text normalization (curly quotes, non-standard spaces), per-package format/lint via make (local hooks for core, langchain, langchain_v1, standard-tests, text-splitters, and partners), version consistency checks (make check_version for each package), and branch protection (no direct commits to master)",
